-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">Magma Caves</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Dye</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.54.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">April 14th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p><p><i><big>\"Burning blooms are fiery flowers that radiate warmth and intensity.\"</big></i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>This rare flower glows neon orange. This flower spawns in the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma tree</a> \"grove\" but there have been instances of them growing lower and closer to the entrance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Caves\" title=\"Magma Caves\">magma caves</a>. It's used to craft the <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard%27s_Bane\" title=\"Blizzard&#39;s Bane\">Blizzard's Bane</a>. It can be sold to <a href=\"/wiki/Jer_Junkman\" title=\"Jer Junkman\"><b>Jer Junkman</b></a> for 350$ per Burning Blossom. It can be turned into Dye by using a <b><a href=\"/wiki/Press_Machine\" title=\"Press Machine\">Press Machine</a></b>.\n</p><p>When put into a <a href=\"/wiki/Composter\" title=\"Composter\">Composter</a>, the fill level increases by ~43.47% per flower.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903140610\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.027 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.036 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 46/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 68/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.007/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019453/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   31.234      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   31.234      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2708-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903140610 and revision id 21958. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Magma Caves","exists":true},{"title":"Blizzard's Bane","exists":true},{"title":"Composter","exists":true},{"title":"Jer Junkman","exists":true},{"title":"Magma Tree","exists":true},{"title":"Petalfall","exists":true},{"title":"Press Machine","exists":true}],"images":["Burning_Blossom.png"]}
